and early access</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground">October 5 worldwide, September 30 for the 5-day head start, plus the exact hours of the launch test and how to convert them.</p><span class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 text-xs font-medium text-foreground hover:text-nav"><span class="border-b border-transparent transition group-hover:border-nav">Read more</span><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-3 w-3 transition group-hover:translate-x-0.5" data-icon="lucide:arrow-right">   <use href="#ai:lucide:arrow-right"></use>  </svg></span></div></a></div></section> <section class="section"> <div class="grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-2">  <div> <div class="flex items-baseline justify-between"> <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Recent updates and changes</h2> <a href="/release/" class="text-sm text-foreground hover:text-nav hover:underline">Browse all</a> </div> <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"> <a href="/classes/chanter/" class="card overflow-hidden"> <img src="/_astro/chanter-cover.BhfD0qZq_Z14CHUF.webp" srcset="/_astro/chanter-cover.BhfD0qZq_Z1Oz4rS.webp 200w, /_astro/chanter-cover.BhfD0qZq_Z14CHUF.webp 400w, /_astro/chanter-cover.BhfD0qZq_Z1T0qrE.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 screenshot of a winged fighter casting a blue energy attack" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 33vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-[16/9] w-full object-cover"> <div class="p-4"> <h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug"> AION 2 Chanter: A Support That Deals Real Damage </h3> <p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground"> Chanter is the staff support class. Undefeated Mantra buffs the whole party, and on a correct build its own damage lands close to a damage class. </p> </div> </a><a href="/classes/cleric/" class="card overflow-hidden"> <img src="/_astro/cleric-cover.BuGjByTc_Z27LwKG.webp" srcset="/_astro/cleric-cover.BuGjByTc_Z23eDNt.webp 200w, /_astro/cleric-cover.BuGjByTc_Z27LwKG.webp 400w, /_astro/cleric-cover.BuGjByTc_UFBlr.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 screenshot of a party of winged characters gathered in a dark hall" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 33vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-[16/9] w-full object-cover"> <div class="p-4"> <h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug"> AION 2 Cleric: Keep the Boss Debuffed, Then Heal </h3> <p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground"> Cleric is the mace-and-shield healer that spends most of a fight on debuffs and damage. Global season 1 allows only four stigma skills at once. </p> </div> </a> </div> </div>  <div> <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">The two pages to read first</h2> <div class="mt-4 grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2"> <a href="/classes/class-list/" class="card overflow-hidden"> <img src="/images/popular-class-list.jpg" alt="Official wallpaper of two armoured Daeva characters, representing class choice" width="400" height="225" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"> <div class="p-4"> <h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug"> All eight classes and their weapons </h3> <p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground"> The official Korean class guide says there are eight classes. The ninth, Brawler, only exists in Korea and Taiwan. Read this table before you pick a main. </p> </div> </a><a href="/release/founders-pack/" class="card overflow-hidden"> <img src="/images/popular-founders-pack.jpg" alt="Official Deluxe Founder's Pack artwork" width="400" height="225" loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"> <div class="p-4"> <h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug"> Founder&#39;s Pack: all three tiers </h3> <p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground"> What USD 24.99, 49.99 and 99.99 actually include, where the difference sits, and how Steam and PURPLE purchase rules differ. </p> </div> </a> </div> </div> </div> <div class="native-banner-slot my-8 flex flex-col items-center" data-ad-format="native-banner"><span class="mb-1 text-[10px] uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground">Advertisement</span><div id="container-f7063624774800dcf880b5b8652d8878" class="adsterra-slot" style="width:min(100%, 728px); min-height:250px" aria-label="Advertisement"></div><script>(function(){const position = "native";
