  })();</script></div> </section> <section id="release" class="section scroll-mt-20"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Release &amp; buying</h2><a href="/release/" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:text-nav">View more<svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4" data-icon="lucide:arrow-right">   <use href="#ai:lucide:arrow-right"></use>  </svg></a></div><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-start gap-4"><a href="/release/mac-and-steam-deck/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/platforms-cover.Duxq5tMV_ZbSA7S.webp" srcset="/_astro/platforms-cover.Duxq5tMV_1VVWps.webp 200w, /_astro/platforms-cover.Duxq5tMV_ZbSA7S.webp 400w, /_astro/platforms-cover.Duxq5tMV_27ucJA.webp 800w" alt="Illustration made for this wiki: a winged golden crest above a stone plinth with translucent panes shaped like a laptop, handheld, tablet and desktop" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">Can You Play AION 2 on Mac or Steam Deck?</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">The global version is Windows PC only, through Steam and PURPLE. Mac, Steam Deck and other non-Windows devices have no official support.</p></div></a><a href="/release/beta-test/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/beta-test-cover.DR4DJBBW_10pkT3.webp" srcset="/_astro/beta-test-cover.DR4DJBBW_Z1UVfmx.webp 200w, /_astro/beta-test-cover.DR4DJBBW_10pkT3.webp 400w, /_astro/beta-test-cover.DR4DJBBW_Z1Ko02p.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 screenshot of a winged Daeva gliding above an ocean archipelago" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 Beta: The Launch Scale Test Is Over</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">Global had one test: the Launch Scale Test on September 17-18, six hours a day, no keys, level cap 37, progress wiped. Founder&#39;s Pack is now the only early route.</p></div></a><a href="/release/ps5-console/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/ps5-console-cover.B3rP7sBT_Z13sesF.webp" srcset="/_astro/ps5-console-cover.B3rP7sBT_Zw3fHK.webp 200w, /_astro/ps5-console-cover.B3rP7sBT_Z13sesF.webp 400w, /_astro/ps5-console-cover.B3rP7sBT_1FsntR.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 key art of a floating fortress under a deep blue night sky" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 on PS5: Confirmed in Development, Not at Launch</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">AION 2 is not on PS5 at launch; it arrives on PC on 5 October 2026. NC&#39;s development PD confirmed in July 2026 that a PS5 version is in development, with no date.</p></div></a><a href="/release/founders-pack/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/founders-pack-cover.DCX3t_Pn_HVTo2.webp" srcset="/_astro/founders-pack-cover.DCX3t_Pn_1ttOTl.webp 200w, /_astro/founders-pack-cover.DCX3t_Pn_HVTo2.webp 400w, /_astro/founders-pack-cover.DCX3t_Pn_Z11Y1ka.webp 800w" alt="Official Ultimate Founder's Pack artwork showing two characters in premium armour skins" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 Founder&#39;s Pack Guide: 24.99 vs 49.99 vs 99.99</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">All three tiers include five days of early access, a supply chest, a unique title and 30 days of membership. Extra tiers buy cosmetics only.</p></div></a><a href="/release/release-date/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/release-date-cover.g-juDFhp_10M7hm.webp" srcset="/_astro/release-date-cover.g-juDFhp_ZOKHVN.webp 200w, /_astro/release-date-cover.g-juDFhp_10M7hm.webp 400w, /_astro/release-date-cover.g-juDFhp_qhlvW.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 key art of a golden citadel above the clouds" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 100vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 Release Date: October 5 Worldwide, September 30 Early</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">AION 2 launches October 5, 2026 on PC - Steam and PURPLE. Founder&#39;s Pack owners get in September 30. Test hours, time zones and where to re-check.</p></div></a></div></section><section id="classes" class="section scroll-mt-20"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Classes</h2><a href="/classes/" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:text-nav">View more<svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4" data-icon="lucide:arrow-right">   <use href="#ai:lucide:arrow-right"></use>  </svg></a></div><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-start gap-4"><a href="/classes/chanter/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/chanter-cover.BhfD0qZq_Z14CHUF.webp" srcset="/_astro/chanter-cover.BhfD0qZq_Z1Oz4rS.webp 200w, /_astro/chanter-cover.BhfD0qZq_Z14CHUF.webp 400w, /_astro/chanter-cover.BhfD0qZq_Z1T0qrE.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 screenshot of a winged fighter casting a blue energy attack" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 Chanter: A Support That Deals Real Damage</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">Chanter is the staff support class. Undefeated Mantra buffs the whole party, and on a correct build its own damage lands close to a damage class.</p></div></a><a href="/classes/cleric/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/cleric-cover.BuGjByTc_Z27LwKG.webp" srcset="/_astro/cleric-cover.BuGjByTc_Z23eDNt.webp 200w, /_astro/cleric-cover.BuGjByTc_Z27LwKG.webp 400w, /_astro/cleric-cover.BuGjByTc_UFBlr.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 screenshot of a party of winged characters gathered in a dark hall" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 Cleric: Keep the Boss Debuffed, Then Heal</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">Cleric is the mace-and-shield healer that spends most of a fight on debuffs and damage. Global season 1 allows only four stigma skills at once.</p></div></a><a href="/classes/gladiator/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/gladiator-cover.Zaq-iyoC_Z1dTQ2B.webp" srcset="/_astro/gladiator-cover.Zaq-iyoC_TUGuJ.webp 200w, /_astro/gladiator-cover.Zaq-iyoC_Z1dTQ2B.webp 400w, /_astro/gladiator-cover.Zaq-iyoC_15sVOR.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 screenshot of an armoured fighter swinging a glowing weapon" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 Gladiator: Off-Tank Damage and a Positional Tax</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">Gladiator is the greatsword off-tank. It tops one-minute dummy parses, drops in live dungeons, and shares a buff that does not stack with Templar.</p></div></a><a href="/classes/ranger/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/ranger-cover.3WiiUllp_Z1rc8c6.webp" srcset="/_astro/ranger-cover.3WiiUllp_Z1mEfeS.webp 200w, /_astro/ranger-cover.3WiiUllp_Z1rc8c6.webp 400w, /_astro/ranger-cover.3WiiUllp_1Bg0U2.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 screenshot of characters flying over floating islands" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 Ranger: The Most Consistent Class in the Game</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">Ranger is a bow class with no positional requirement. It sits in the top three or four in nearly every fight, and its mana bar is the early bottleneck.</p></div></a><a href="/classes/spiritmaster/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/spiritmaster-cover.OU-IyZP8_1dqgPd.webp" srcset="/_astro/spiritmaster-cover.OU-IyZP8_ZC7ynW.webp 200w, /_astro/spiritmaster-cover.OU-IyZP8_1dqgPd.webp 400w, /_astro/spiritmaster-cover.OU-IyZP8_CUv4N.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 screenshot of a robed caster surrounded by swirling blue magic" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 Spiritmaster: Five Spirits, One Rotation</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">Spiritmaster is a ranged magic summoner that rotates five elemental spirits, builds four element stacks and dumps Elemental Fusion for 15-20% of its damage.</p></div></a><a href="/classes/best-class/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/best-class-cover.BFmm4tmg_ZJuVzK.webp" srcset="/_astro/best-class-cover.BFmm4tmg_1EDApS.webp 200w, /_astro/best-class-cover.BFmm4tmg_ZJuVzK.webp 400w, /_astro/best-class-cover.BFmm4tmg_VTgwB.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 wallpaper of a robed caster holding a staff before a giant masked statue in a blue hall" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 Best Class: What All Eight Are Actually Good At</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">What each of the eight launch classes does best, which are easiest and hardest to play, and why no verified global tier list exists yet. Four steps to pick a main.</p></div></a><a href="/classes/brawler/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/brawler-cover.DOBeYcm1_Z2oTsTX.webp" srcset="/_astro/brawler-cover.DOBeYcm1_1UljmK.webp 200w, /_astro/brawler-cover.DOBeYcm1_Z2oTsTX.webp 400w, /_astro/brawler-cover.DOBeYcm1_1PTWmY.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 key art of a dark-winged melee fighter against a stormy sky" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 Brawler: Gauntlets, Rage and Whether Global Gets It</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">Brawler fights with gauntlets and builds Rage into a Rampage state. It arrived with Chapter 1 in Korea and Taiwan on July 1, 2026. It is not on the global roster.</p></div></a><a href="/classes/class-list/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/class-list-cover.CMEaEBnn_1kgd3b.webp" srcset="/_astro/class-list-cover.CMEaEBnn_Z1kLnK7.webp 200w, /_astro/class-list-cover.CMEaEBnn_1kgd3b.webp 400w, /_astro/class-list-cover.CMEaEBnn_Z23vHDo.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 screenshot of the character customisation screen with sliders and colour swatches" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 Classes: All Eight, Their Roles and Weapons</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">The official Korean class guide says eight classes exist, expected for global launch too. Brawler shipped only in Korea and Taiwan. One main weapon each.</p></div></a></div></section><section id="combat" class="section scroll-mt-20"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Combat &amp; dungeons</h2><a href="/combat/" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:text-nav">View more<svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4" data-icon="lucide:arrow-right">   <use href="#ai:lucide:arrow-right"></use>  </svg></a></div><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-start gap-4"><a href="/combat/dungeons/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/dungeons-cover.VNuqLPnq_Z1v1xYM.webp" srcset="/_astro/dungeons-cover.VNuqLPnq_Z2tOxnx.webp 200w, /_astro/dungeons-cover.VNuqLPnq_Z1v1xYM.webp 400w, /_astro/dungeons-cover.VNuqLPnq_ZDsxJT.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 screenshot of a party fighting inside a glowing teal cavern" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 33vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 Dungeons and PvE: How to Spend Week One</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">Over 200 dungeons across solo, 5-player and 10-player formats, with four named 5-player Expeditions. Week one, run what raises your item level first.</p></div></a><a href="/combat/pvp/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/pvp-cover.D95HpPtc_16Ei0M.webp" srcset="/_astro/pvp-cover.D95HpPtc_ZJiSz3.webp 200w, /_astro/pvp-cover.D95HpPtc_16Ei0M.webp 400w, /_astro/pvp-cover.D95HpPtc_VWGCU.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 key art of winged fighters over a red-lit canyon" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 33vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 PvP: Faction War, Capped Battlefields, Real Complaints</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">Two levels of PvP: open-world Abyss and faction war, plus rule-bound modes. NC confirmed Chaotic Upper Reshanta and Battlefield: Siege.</p></div></a><a href="/combat/gameplay/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/gameplay-cover.BcZih5Kc_FhhoE.webp" srcset="/_astro/gameplay-cover.BcZih5Kc_ZivGY6.webp 200w, /_astro/gameplay-cover.BcZih5Kc_FhhoE.webp 400w, /_astro/gameplay-cover.BcZih5Kc_1wPhDx.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 screenshot of a rocky highland region seen from the air" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 33vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 Gameplay: Why Flight Counts As Combat</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">A world 36 times the original on Unreal Engine 5, where flight is not travel but the way you fight. Over 200 dungeons, tied together by the Abyss.</p></div></a></div></section><section id="guide" class="section scroll-mt-20"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Guides</h2><a href="/guide/" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:text-nav">View more<svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4" data-icon="lucide:arrow-right">   <use href="#ai:lucide:arrow-right"></use>  </svg></a></div><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-start gap-4"><a href="/guide/kinah/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/kinah-cover.Cqruej6__Z1VGOY2.webp" srcset="/_astro/kinah-cover.Cqruej6__1UBnK1.webp 200w, /_astro/kinah-cover.Cqruej6__Z1VGOY2.webp 400w, /_astro/kinah-cover.Cqruej6__pmnkY.webp 800w" alt="Illustration made for this wiki: a torch-lit floating market with crates, potions and glowing coin sigils" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 Kinah: The Two Currencies and Your First Week</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">Bound and unbound Kinah, dungeon energy farming, alchemy and crafting maths, open-world versus Abyss caps, and where early Kinah should go first.</p></div></a><a href="/guide/steam-and-purple/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/steam-and-purple-cover.CqD0ranT_Z1FPzv5.webp" srcset="/_astro/steam-and-purple-cover.CqD0ranT_Z1bDsjW.webp 200w, /_astro/steam-and-purple-cover.CqD0ranT_Z1FPzv5.webp 400w, /_astro/steam-and-purple-cover.CqD0ranT_Z4sKmO.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 wallpaper with the AION emblem on a bright sky background" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 Download Guide: Steam or PURPLE, Five Prep Steps</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">Two official entry points: Steam (app 3393110) and NC&#39;s PURPLE launcher. Eight in-game languages and four server regions, plus five things to do before launch.</p></div></a><a href="/guide/beginner-guide/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/beginner-guide-cover.1aWWUyuO_Z1SiBNA.webp" srcset="/_astro/beginner-guide-cover.1aWWUyuO_Z1D1fhu.webp 200w, /_astro/beginner-guide-cover.1aWWUyuO_Z1SiBNA.webp 400w, /_astro/beginner-guide-cover.1aWWUyuO_J3x8i.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 screenshot of a sunlit island with a large tree and player characters" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 Beginner Guide: Three Decisions, Then Week One</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">Before launch, lock faction, server and class. On day one, test both control modes, follow the main quest and run one dungeon. The traps that cost the most time.</p></div></a><a href="/guide/system-requirements/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/system-requirements-cover.D9om65Hx_jAqnU.webp" srcset="/_astro/system-requirements-cover.D9om65Hx_Z15jEDY.webp 200w, /_astro/system-requirements-cover.D9om65Hx_jAqnU.webp 400w, /_astro/system-requirements-cover.D9om65Hx_Z1dKlMh.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 screenshot of a detailed blue-lit crystal cavern" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 25vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">AION 2 System Requirements: Minimum, Recommended, 100 GB</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">Official minimum: Ryzen 5 2600 / i5-10500, 8 GB RAM, GTX 1050 Ti, 100 GB. Recommended: Ryzen 7 3700X / i7-11700, 16 GB, RTX 2070. Both tiers recommend an SSD.</p></div></a></div></section><section id="review" class="section scroll-mt-20"><div class="flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Reviews &amp; monetization</h2><a href="/review/" class="inline-flex shrink-0 items-center gap-1 text-sm font-medium text-foreground hover:text-nav">View more<svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4" data-icon="lucide:arrow-right">   <use href="#ai:lucide:arrow-right"></use>  </svg></a></div><div class="mt-4 flex flex-wrap items-start gap-4"><a href="/review/monetization/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/monetization-cover.BD7ISUBs_Z1rxO83.webp" srcset="/_astro/monetization-cover.BD7ISUBs_1M5trI.webp 200w, /_astro/monetization-cover.BD7ISUBs_Z1rxO83.webp 400w, /_astro/monetization-cover.BD7ISUBs_Z223zSs.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 screenshot of a character with blazing golden wings and a flame weapon" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 50vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">Is AION 2 Pay To Win? Every Charge, Line By Line</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">Free to play with an optional USD 15/month membership unlocking the Market and Kina-to-Quna exchange. The shop is cosmetics and consumables, NC says no power.</p></div></a><a href="/review/worth-playing/" class="card basis-[260px] grow overflow-hidden"><img src="/_astro/worth-playing-cover.D-GmiHGJ_2pJSmq.webp" srcset="/_astro/worth-playing-cover.D-GmiHGJ_Z1STjVc.webp 200w, /_astro/worth-playing-cover.D-GmiHGJ_2pJSmq.webp 400w, /_astro/worth-playing-cover.D-GmiHGJ_ENWDe.webp 800w" alt="Official AION 2 wallpaper of two Daeva characters with the AION emblem between them" sizes="(max-width: 640px) 100vw, (max-width: 1024px) 50vw, 50vw" loading="lazy" decoding="async" fetchpriority="auto" width="400" height="225" class="aspect-video w-full object-cover"><div class="p-4"><h3 class="line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.75rem] font-semibold leading-snug">Is AION 2 Worth Playing? The Answer Splits By Player Type</h3><p class="mt-1 line-clamp-2 min-h-[2.5rem] text-sm text-muted-foreground">Reviews agree on the visuals and progression pacing, and agree on the mobile-feel UI, repetitive endgame and simplified combat. Global is untested.</p></div></a></div></section> <section id="faq" class="section scroll-mt-20"> <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold tracking-tight md:text-4xl">AION 2 FAQ</h2> <p class="mt-2 text-muted-foreground">Release, platforms, classes, dungeons, monetization and PC specs - every answer traces back to an official page.</p> <div class="mt-8 grid items-start gap-3 lg:grid-cols-2" data-faq-group> <details class="card group rounded-md"> <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between p-4 font-medium" aria-expanded="false"> When does AION 2 launch? <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 transition group-open:rotate-180" data-icon="lucide:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:lucide:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground"> <p>October 5, 2026 worldwide, on PC only - Steam and PURPLE. A Founder&#39;s Pack gets you in five days earlier, from September 30.</p> <a href="/release/release-date/" class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-nav hover:underline"> See the full timeline <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" data-icon="lucide:arrow-right">   <use href="#ai:lucide:arrow-right"></use>  </svg> </a> </div> </details><details class="card group rounded-md"> <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between p-4 font-medium" aria-expanded="false"> Can I play it on PS5 or mobile? <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 transition group-open:rotate-180" data-icon="lucide:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:lucide:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground"> <p>Launch is PC only. NC&#39;s development PD confirmed a PS5 version is in development but gave no date. Mobile exists only in Korea and Taiwan; the global version officially has none.</p> <a href="/release/ps5-console/" class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-nav hover:underline"> See platform status <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" data-icon="lucide:arrow-right">   <use href="#ai:lucide:arrow-right"></use>  </svg> </a> </div> </details><details class="card group rounded-md"> <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between p-4 font-medium" aria-expanded="false"> How many classes are there? <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 transition group-open:rotate-180" data-icon="lucide:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:lucide:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground"> <p>The official Korean class guide says eight. Global launch is expected to be those eight. The ninth, Brawler, shipped only in Korea and Taiwan.</p> <a href="/classes/class-list/" class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-nav hover:underline"> See the class list <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" data-icon="lucide:arrow-right">   <use href="#ai:lucide:arrow-right"></use>  </svg> </a> </div> </details><details class="card group rounded-md"> <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between p-4 font-medium" aria-expanded="false"> Will Brawler be in the global launch? <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 transition group-open:rotate-180" data-icon="lucide:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:lucide:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground"> <p>NC has published no global roster as of September 18, 2026. Creators who play the Korea/Taiwan service believe global launches with eight and no Brawler - but that is a creator report, not an official announcement.</p> <a href="/classes/brawler/" class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-nav hover:underline"> See how Brawler plays <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" data-icon="lucide:arrow-right">   <use href="#ai:lucide:arrow-right"></use>  </svg> </a> </div> </details><details class="card group rounded-md"> <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between p-4 font-medium" aria-expanded="false"> Can my PC run it? <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 transition group-open:rotate-180" data-icon="lucide:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:lucide:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground"> <p>Minimum is Ryzen 5 2600 / i5-10500, 8 GB RAM and GTX 1050 Ti (4GB). Recommended is Ryzen 7 3700X / i7-11700, 16 GB and RTX 2070 (8GB). Both tiers need 100 GB and both recommend an SSD.</p> <a href="/guide/system-requirements/" class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-nav hover:underline"> See the spec table <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" data-icon="lucide:arrow-right">   <use href="#ai:lucide:arrow-right"></use>  </svg> </a> </div> </details><details class="card group rounded-md"> <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between p-4 font-medium" aria-expanded="false"> Is AION 2 pay to win? <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 transition group-open:rotate-180" data-icon="lucide:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:lucide:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground"> <p>It is free to play with an optional USD 15/month membership. The membership unlocks the Market and the Kina-to-Quna exchange. The shop is cosmetics and consumables, which NC says do not affect power. Whether buying Kina with real money crosses your line is your call.</p> <a href="/review/monetization/" class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-nav hover:underline"> See the full breakdown <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" data-icon="lucide:arrow-right">   <use href="#ai:lucide:arrow-right"></use>  </svg> </a> </div> </details><details class="card group rounded-md"> <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between p-4 font-medium" aria-expanded="false"> Are the Founder&#39;s Packs worth it? <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 transition group-open:rotate-180" data-icon="lucide:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:lucide:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground"> <p>All three include five days of early access, a supply chest, a unique title and 30 days of membership. The extra tiers are entirely cosmetics - no power. Worth it only if you want those looks or the day-one head start.</p> <a href="/release/founders-pack/" class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-nav hover:underline"> Compare the three tiers <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" data-icon="lucide:arrow-right">   <use href="#ai:lucide:arrow-right"></use>  </svg> </a> </div> </details><details class="card group rounded-md"> <summary class="flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between p-4 font-medium" aria-expanded="false"> Is there another beta I can join? <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4 transition group-open:rotate-180" data-icon="lucide:chevron-down">   <use href="#ai:lucide:chevron-down"></use>  </svg> </summary> <div class="px-4 pb-4 text-sm text-muted-foreground"> <p>No. The only test was the Launch Scale Test on September 17-18, six hours a day, no keys, progress wiped. The only way to play earlier now is Founder&#39;s Pack early access.</p> <a href="/release/beta-test/" class="mt-3 inline-flex items-center gap-1 font-medium text-nav hover:underline"> Read the test recap <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-3.5 w-3.5" data-icon="lucide:arrow-right">   <use href="#ai:lucide:arrow-right"></use>  </svg> </a> </div> </details> </div> </section> <script>
  // Sync aria-expanded on FAQ summaries when details toggle.
  document.querySelectorAll('[data-faq-group] details').forEach((d) => {
    const sync = () =>
      d.querySelector('summary')?.setAttribute('aria-expanded', d.open ? 'true' : 'false');
    sync();
    d.addEventListener('toggle', sync);
  });
</script><section class="section"> <div class="card p-8 text-center md:p-12"> <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold md:text-3xl">Get the facts straight before you spend anything</h2> <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-xl text-muted-foreground">Release, classes, dungeon budgets, monetization and specs all trace back to official pages. Where nothing has been published, this wiki says so.</p> <div class="mt-6 flex justify-center gap-3"> <a href="/guide/steam-and-purple/" class="btn-primary"> View on Steam </a> <a href="/guide/" class="btn-outline"> Browse all pages </a> </div> </div> </section> </main> </div> <footer class="site-footer mt-16 border-t border-border"> <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-4 py-10"> <div class="grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-3">  <div> <div class="flex items-center gap-2 font-bold"> <img src="/favicon-96x96.png" alt="" width="24" height="24" class="h-6 w-6"> <span class="bg-gradient-to-r from-nav via-foreground to-nav/75 bg-clip-text text-transparent"> AION 2 Wiki </span> </div> <p class="mt-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground"> The sky is the battlefield - verified AION 2 guides </p> </div>  <div> <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-muted-foreground"> Official links </h2> <ul class="mt-3 space-y-2"> <li> <a href="https://aion2.plaync.com/en-us/conts/teaser" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-foreground/80 transition hover:text-nav"> <svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" class="h-4 w-4" data-icon="lucide:globe">   <use href="#ai:lucide:globe"></use>  </svg> Official website </a> </li><li> <a href="https://store.steampowered.com/app/3393110/AION_2/" rel="noopener noreferrer" target="_blank" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-foreground/80 transition hover:text-nav"> <svg width="1em" height="1em" class="h-4 w-4" data-icon="lucide:external-link">   <symbol id="ai:lucide:external-link" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="